              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "bill"
            },
            "reviewBody": "you can skip the butter and add 2 slices of bacon to one side of the hot cooker then the bread make well for egg. add egg then cheese then bread and 2 slices of bacon on top and cook. we make them every time we camp they are the best",
