              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yayoo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What I love about the sandwich makers is that ANY recipe tastes good. My twist on this sandwich is that I put bacon on the outsides of the bread so that it cooks up all crispy and wonderful with your egg and cheese inside. Make sure you flip too. That's the key... YUMMMMY!",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-20T16:35:37.280Z"
